$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Theta Draconis IV" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Night" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> Out here in the gehtto of the Draconis Galaxy, life is rough and without a disc launcher and some mad punk style skillz, you'll get capped before you know it. The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> gangs got 4 stations each, and they also got some of them pimped out cruisers y'all call planes, we call em' deathcarts, cuz only newbies use em' and they always die. Watch out for them plasmas on the roofs, and make sure you got yo defense up and ready for flag cappers, who can ski in and out easy. Watch out now, and stay away from the thugs on the corner.";
